      "updated": 1787072873971,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "buy = prices[0], maxProfit = 0\nfor each price:\n  if price < buy  → update buy\n  if price > buy  → profit = price - buy\n                    maxProfit = max(maxProfit, profit)\n\nTrack lowest buy, compute max gain",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "index": "a6",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "buy = prices[0], maxProfit = 0\nfor each price:\n  if price < buy  → update buy\n  if price > buy  → profit = price - buy\n                    maxProfit = max(maxProfit, profit)\n\nTrack lowest buy, compute max gain",
      "autoResize": true,
